      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general audience of internet users who can relate to feelings of frustration, helplessness, or being overwhelmed by digital tasks or situations. The visual of a distressed woman at a laptop is universally relatable and does not target any specific demographic based on protected characteristics.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
